  "description": {
   "en": "In her past life, she was a girl who adored otome games and always dreamed of reincarnating as her favorite villainess after death. But when her wish was finally granted, she was met with a shocking truth—she wasn’t reborn as the villainess, but as the story’s main heroine!\n\n“No, this isn’t what I wanted! This isn’t my place!”\n\nHer original plan was to live peacefully as the villainess’s sister, staying by her side without getting involved in any unnecessary drama. But now that she’s the heroine, she has no choice but to take action and rewrite the course of the story if she ever hopes to achieve the ending she truly desires!\n\nCan she bend fate to her will, or does being the heroine mean she’s doomed to follow the story as it was written?\n\nA hilarious and romantic journey filled with unexpected twists, as a girl struggles to adapt to a destiny she never saw coming!",
   "ja": "生前、大好きな乙女ゲームの悪役令嬢に転生したかった病弱な少女・響子。願いは届き転生が叶うも、その転生先は光のヒロイン・リサ!?　違う、そっちじゃなーい！悪役令嬢の兄である推しのヒースクリフ様と兄妹でひっそり生きていくことが叶わぬなら…、未来を変えるために行動あるのみ！"
  },
